    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your own Ship part by part to suit your style, customize it for Combat, Trading, Mining, or Salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of Deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Ship Pressure Health System! Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore those ever-changing sectors, where abandoned spaceships, deserted space stations, and hidden relics await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in immersive space combat, as your enemies find themselves in distress, spare them in their leak crisis, or finish them off once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Leaks in Space</strong> is a 2D sandbox space sim featuring Combat, Ship building, Mining, Trading and Exploring a procedurally generated galaxy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/797dc668fed0b45f2568552690ad066d.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and build your own Ship part by part to suit your style, customize it for Combat, Trading, Mining, or Salvaging. Upgrade engines, weapons, cargo holds, and pressure regulators to survive the dangers of Deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/1bdf0f286b2cd6f44542a9fcc79acd55.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique Ship Pressure Health System! Every damage creates a stackable leak that gradually reduces ship's pressure over time. Patch them during combat or risk total shutdown or retreat to a station for full repairs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/e721a3a6233b69a809d552055967508d.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore those ever-changing sectors, where abandoned spaceships, deserted space stations, and hidden relics await your discovery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/77ba72f61a401cf17c64dc12073158b1.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources by mining asteroids or salvaging derelict ships, then sell your loot at space stations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.poster.avif?t=1755274447\" width=600 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.webm?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3561170/extras/697f36ad86a4c385112b1a161d640eb7.mp4?t=1755274447\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in immersive space combat, as your enemies find themselves in distress, spare them in their leak crisis, or finish them off once and for all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
